      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在创作\n参赛用的风景画，可是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B635728521B4F5C000A53C28D5B7528768498CE666F753BFF0C53EF662F20262026001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你看啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60770B554AFF01001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "藤蔓的痕迹挡在喷泉前面，\n好碍事啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "85E48513768475D58FF96321572855B76CC9524D9762FF0C000A597D788D4E8B554AFF01001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但以我的宝可梦的招式\n没办法破坏它……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
