      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啸木木～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "557867286728FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "距离比赛没几天了，\n我这么着急，你干嘛要搞恶作剧呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8DDD79BB6BD48D5B6CA151E059294E86FF0C000A62118FD94E4877406025FF0C4F605E72561B8981641E60764F5C52675462FF1F001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！灵感来了！\n小木灵和喷泉！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF017075611F67654E86FF01000A5C0F67287075548C55B76CC9FF01FF01001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给我画的喷泉加上小木灵，\n是体现了对当今的密阿雷的看法。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n小木灵！\n你来当我画画的模特吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED96211753B768455B76CC952A04E0A5C0F67287075FF0C000A662F4F5373B04E865BF95F534ECA76845BC6963F96F77684770B6CD5300200100001BE01000A5C0F67287075FF01000A4F6067655F536211753B753B76846A21727954273002001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啸木～！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55786728FF5EFF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们齐心协力的话，\n一定能给密阿雷美术馆送上世纪大杰作！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n到我画完为止，\n你都要待在那里不许动哦，小木灵！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC9F505FC3534F529B76848BDDFF0C000A4E005B9A80FD7ED95BC6963F96F77F8E672F998690014E0A4E167EAA592767704F5CFF0100100001BE01000A52306211753B5B8C4E3A6B62FF0C000A4F6090FD89815F85572890A391CC4E0D8BB852A854E6FF0C5C0F67287075FF01001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啸木木……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "557867286728202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢！多亏了你，\n我一定能拿下比赛的冠军！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
